    "long_instructions": "## Use AI to Code Your Web App - Structure \r\n\r\n1. **Prompt AI for HTML**  \r\n   Ask AI to create the web app you outlined for your selected user. Copy and paste the prompt you drafted in Level 1 and clarify that you just want the `index.html` file.\r\n\r\n2. **Accept and Save**  \r\n   Briefly describe what AI changed, e.g. `Created index.html for garden web app` Then click **\"Accept and save version\"**.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
